  "description": "Conquer the city and then leave it behind with the Novus; an electric bike made for adventure off-road and on. Commute… dominated. Weekends… upgraded. With a sealed internal gear system, the Novus Hub keeps maintenance to a minimum and rides silky-smooth - whether you’re coasting through the city or heading for the hills. Driven by a Bosch Performance Line motor and a robust 600wh battery, it delivers up to 83 miles of reliable power. Off-road tyres, 100mm front suspension and hydraulic disc brakes ensure it handles rough tracks and busy streets with equal poise. Mudguards, integrated lights and a 25kg rear rack are all standard — naturally. From the first ride, you’ll notice the details: ergonomic grips, a supportive Selle Royal Essenza saddle, and your choice of crossbar or step-through frame. It’s designed to keep you comfortable, however far you roam. Effortless to ride. Effortless to live with. Novus Hub is made for those who prefer life without the unnecessary. Range Calculator Use this calculator to better estimate the range you might achieve based on your riding conditions: Bosch Ebike Calculator (Please check the specification to ensure your select the correct motor and battery. The total travel distance will depend on the capacity of the battery, rider and luggage weight, power mode setting and riding style.) Important Please be aware that this bike is regulated in line with existing Electric Power Assisted Cycles regulations. Any modification to the bike will invalidate the guarantee and in particular any modification which increases the power of the motor and/or the top assisted speed of the bike may make the rider liable to prosecution. Excluding statutory obligations Raleigh will not be held responsible for any injuries incurred following any modification to this product.",
